msgid "A guided SEO workflow, not just field access. Scan the whole site for a scored report card, generate brand-voice titles + meta descriptions that pass length + uniqueness validation, build and validate structured data, fix canonicals/robots/alt text in bulk, migrate meta between SEO plugins, and gate drafts before publish. Every write runs through a dry-run → validate → commit pipeline so nothing bad lands."
